{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "dxzvon9yet37i8n2", "title": "15.对话系统的多租户隔离方案", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b0279e3\" id=\"u2b0279e3\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uab6e49b6\" id=\"uab6e49b6\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752995328080-cc13ef2d-6ce4-403d-9a73-beac385d41fd.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucf0527c9-afc8-4865-b79b-cc282262a1c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u63e39363-fe73-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A499.2%2C%22height%22%3A337%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A102764%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A936%2C%22originHeight%22%3A632%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%9A%E7%A7%9F%E6%88%B7%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%22%2C%22x%22%3A719%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E9%9A%94%E7%A6%BB%22%2C%22x%22%3A719%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%9A%94%E7%A6%BB%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A372%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A128%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E5%90%88%E8%A7%84%22%2C%22x%22%3A718%2C%22y%22%3A561%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9A%94%E7%A6%BB%22%2C%22x%22%3A720%2C%22y%22%3A300%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%9A%94%E7%A6%BB%22%2C%22x%22%3A719%2C%22y%22%3A475%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22x%22%3A374%2C%22y%22%3A389%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%A1%83%E6%88%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A717%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9A%94%E7%A6%BB%22%2C%22x%22%3A718%2C%22y%22%3A214%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%AD%94%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A300%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f8f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0eaf5b01%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1ca14768\" id=\"u1ca14768\"><span data-lake-id=\"u428c6dcb\" id=\"u428c6dcb\">多租户隔离在对话系统中指同一套系统同时服务多个独立客户（租户），确保各租户的数据、配置、模型和业务逻辑完全隔离，避免数据泄露或交叉干扰。核心挑战在于</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uab3fbb36\" id=\"uab3fbb36\">资源复用与安全隔离的平衡</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u09bf8051\" id=\"u09bf8051\">，需从以下维度设计：</span></p><ol list=\"ua99a9b56\"><li fid=\"ue168774b\" data-lake-id=\"uf37ff93a\" id=\"uf37ff93a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u746ddf74\" id=\"u746ddf74\">数据隔离</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5ab37417\" id=\"u5ab37417\">：租户数据物理/逻辑分离。</span></li><li fid=\"ue168774b\" data-lake-id=\"u7497a163\" id=\"u7497a163\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6b394e97\" id=\"u6b394e97\">模型隔离</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5eec4ad1\" id=\"u5eec4ad1\">：定制模型或共享基座+租户微调。</span></li><li fid=\"ue168774b\" data-lake-id=\"ua86227eb\" id=\"ua86227eb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5329a2d3\" id=\"u5329a2d3\">配置隔离</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u42fca281\" id=\"u42fca281\">：对话流程、权限策略独立管理。</span></li><li fid=\"ue168774b\" data-lake-id=\"u993030b0\" id=\"u993030b0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua61d7110\" id=\"ua61d7110\">性能隔离</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u64ed05a2\" id=\"u64ed05a2\">：资源分配防抢占。</span></li><li fid=\"ue168774b\" data-lake-id=\"ufbe946a3\" id=\"ufbe946a3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u09b797df\" id=\"u09b797df\">安全合规</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u083d3822\" id=\"u083d3822\">：满足GDPR等数据驻留要求。</span></li></ol><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tP6EG%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"44fd2dba\" id=\"44fd2dba\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3253e8bc\" id=\"u3253e8bc\">二、项目案例：某金融SaaS客服平台</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uc18a8a22\" id=\"uc18a8a22\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752995350638-96b76f7e-620f-4af8-a700-204a09daf418.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u575df8da-1132-421a-b98a-82b5f46c31c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u63e39363-fe73-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A476.8%2C%22height%22%3A233%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A63187%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A894%2C%22originHeight%22%3A436%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A725%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A200%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E6%8A%A2%E5%8D%A0%22%2C%22x%22%3A726%2C%22y%22%3A374%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E7%97%9B%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A379%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A722%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A722%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%22%2C%22x%22%3A722%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f8f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6eb6ad96%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"eb5e395f\" id=\"eb5e395f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u682b2db8\" id=\"u682b2db8\">场景与痛点</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u19baf055\" id=\"u19baf055\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ude10a918\" id=\"ude10a918\">背景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u121582a8\" id=\"u121582a8\">：平台为银行、保险、证券等金融机构提供智能客服，客户包括</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9f390fe8\" id=\"u9f390fe8\">国有银行A</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udab2336d\" id=\"udab2336d\">、</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u17969bfc\" id=\"u17969bfc\">互联网保险B</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udd41c179\" id=\"udd41c179\">、</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0cd1dc8b\" id=\"u0cd1dc8b\">券商C</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0ceddaa1\" id=\"u0ceddaa1\">，日均对话量超200万次。<br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u32166ecf\" id=\"u32166ecf\">痛点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uccececfc\" id=\"uccececfc\">：</span></p><ol list=\"u364bdeef\"><li fid=\"ufc79d695\" data-lake-id=\"u4bf04af7\" id=\"u4bf04af7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u97f46b4b\" id=\"u97f46b4b\">数据泄露风险</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4a7c874f\" id=\"u4a7c874f\">：银行A要求客户交易数据不可离开其私有云，但保险B的营销话术需实时更新至公有云。</span></li><li fid=\"ufc79d695\" data-lake-id=\"u74d2c0d3\" id=\"u74d2c0d3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u12f547fa\" id=\"u12f547fa\">模型干扰</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u77a8ccf1\" id=\"u77a8ccf1\">：银行A的“贷款审批”对话需严谨合规，而保险B需活泼营销风格，同一模型无法兼顾。</span></li><li fid=\"ufc79d695\" data-lake-id=\"u838ad8e8\" id=\"u838ad8e8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4aeb1715\" id=\"u4aeb1715\">配置冲突</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uac817179\" id=\"uac817179\">：券商C需嵌入实时股价查询API，银行A需对接内部风控系统，通用流程无法满足。</span></li><li fid=\"ufc79d695\" data-lake-id=\"u87fb13b8\" id=\"u87fb13b8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufbf37f64\" id=\"ufbf37f64\">性能抢占</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u04584caf\" id=\"u04584caf\">：保险B促销期间流量激增，导致银行A的VIP客户服务延迟。</span></li></ol><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Y5FBj%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"d2995c56\" id=\"d2995c56\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d2a4d75\" id=\"u0d2a4d75\">三、参考回答：多租户隔离方案设计与落地</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"81cbf7d0\" id=\"81cbf7d0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u97dd484b\" id=\"u97dd484b\">1. 数据隔离：混合存储架构</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ub8a85399\" id=\"ub8a85399\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752995408931-f498b5cf-d101-4a44-806c-8e671540d204.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9e8fba0d-5b7e-4769-9731-73d7b70c031%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u63e39363-fe73-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A337.8000183105469%2C%22height%22%3A158%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A23113%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A459%2C%22originHeight%22%3A215%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A312%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%22%2C%22x%22%3A312%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A22%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%A0%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A311%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u41f564b5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><ul list=\"u208b60cc\"><li fid=\"ufa98e557\" data-lake-id=\"ufbdc5408\" id=\"ufbdc5408\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u281f666c\" id=\"u281f666c\">方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7e830215\" id=\"u7e830215\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u208b60cc\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u521fc045\" data-lake-id=\"u8a6c4c5e\" id=\"u8a6c4c5e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub36b620a\" id=\"ub36b620a\">敏感数据</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u56a41f1b\" id=\"u56a41f1b\">（如银行交易记录）：存于租户独享的私有云数据库，通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7164d24c\" id=\"u7164d24c\">VPC网络隔离</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ube8d18ef\" id=\"ube8d18ef\">+</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub9016d34\" id=\"ub9016d34\">字段级加密</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5d773523\" id=\"u5d773523\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u521fc045\" data-lake-id=\"u53d3f9c5\" id=\"u53d3f9c5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5f27becd\" id=\"u5f27becd\">通用数据</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u08384ae3\" id=\"u08384ae3\">（如FAQ知识库）：存于共享的向量数据库（如Milvus），通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uae203c13\" id=\"uae203c13\">租户ID标签</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3e06c9c2\" id=\"u3e06c9c2\">逻辑隔离。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u208b60cc\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"ufa98e557\" data-lake-id=\"u190154eb\" id=\"u190154eb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u32599ed6\" id=\"u32599ed6\">案例实现</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubbbabcb2\" id=\"ubbbabcb2\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u208b60cc\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u4a2f9163\" data-lake-id=\"uae36295c\" id=\"uae36295c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c38857e\" id=\"u8c38857e\">银行A的数据存储于其本地IDC，通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u24435a60\" id=\"u24435a60\">双向VPN</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u890df04b\" id=\"u890df04b\">与平台同步非敏感元数据（如对话时长统计）。</span></li><li fid=\"u4a2f9163\" data-lake-id=\"u5e7e7c3a\" id=\"u5e7e7c3a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u457bbbe7\" id=\"u457bbbe7\">向量检索时增加</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5cc07d6c\" id=\"u5cc07d6c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f709f21\" id=\"u4f709f21\">tenant_id</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub58477dc\" id=\"ub58477dc\">过滤（例：</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf22fc039\" id=\"uf22fc039\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87b12a39\" id=\"u87b12a39\">WHERE tenant_id='bank_A' AND query='贷款利率'</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8f96121e\" id=\"u8f96121e\">）。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u208b60cc\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"ufa98e557\" data-lake-id=\"ud4c573df\" id=\"ud4c573df\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubaecfe81\" id=\"ubaecfe81\">技术栈</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0fa85bdb\" id=\"u0fa85bdb\">：AWS VPC + HashiCorp Vault（密钥管理） + PostgreSQL Row-Level Security。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"d591499d\" id=\"d591499d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2503513d\" id=\"u2503513d\">2. 模型隔离：动态微调基座模型</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ue1f4e9f5\" id=\"ue1f4e9f5\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752995424044-04a15c9c-64e6-46ff-91ff-d2bf5beead7e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue702e73b-0788-4ccb-ad4e-bef69879c41%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u63e39363-fe73-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A368.0666809082031%2C%22height%22%3A201%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A32086%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A497%2C%22originHeight%22%3A271%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A330%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9F%BA%E5%BA%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A330%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A7%9F%E6%88%B7%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A88%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%A0%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub1e3b1de%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><ul list=\"u26cdab60\"><li fid=\"u8fce78e0\" data-lake-id=\"udc7fdaa3\" id=\"udc7fdaa3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u87dc374e\" id=\"u87dc374e\">方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u571a9182\" id=\"u571a9182\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u26cdab60\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u0f9cecf9\" data-lake-id=\"u846680e6\" id=\"u846680e6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u86a46eeb\" id=\"u86a46eeb\">基座模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7dbcc744\" id=\"u7dbcc744\">：共享LLM（如LLaMA 13B）处理通用任务（如问候语）。</span></li><li fid=\"u0f9cecf9\" data-lake-id=\"u6612b8b1\" id=\"u6612b8b1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uba4d578f\" id=\"uba4d578f\">租户定制</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u43cf0817\" id=\"u43cf0817\">：为高需求租户（如银行A）部署</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0bdd46b4\" id=\"u0bdd46b4\">LoRA微调模块</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u646ca9da\" id=\"u646ca9da\">，加载专属适配器（如</span><code data-lake-id=\"u809c3c37\" id=\"u809c3c37\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub118357a\" id=\"ub118357a\">bank_A_lora.adapter</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u40fe555b\" id=\"u40fe555b\">）。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u26cdab60\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u8fce78e0\" data-lake-id=\"u006ef333\" id=\"u006ef333\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6ae7ad25\" id=\"u6ae7ad25\">案例实现</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufc9f47c1\" id=\"ufc9f47c1\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u26cdab60\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u1d8bfa8d\" data-lake-id=\"ue302bcbb\" id=\"ue302bcbb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7037192\" id=\"ue7037192\">银行A的贷款审批对话使用</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u257b6b56\" id=\"u257b6b56\">合规性微调</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u86d8d39a\" id=\"u86d8d39a\">：在基座模型上叠加LoRA层，训练数据仅含金融监管条款。</span></li><li fid=\"u1d8bfa8d\" data-lake-id=\"u9c84883d\" id=\"u9c84883d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u156224c4\" id=\"u156224c4\">保险B的营销对话启用</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u26464c77\" id=\"u26464c77\">风格控制</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u09fb5f26\" id=\"u09fb5f26\">：通过Prompt注入“亲切口语化”风格参数（</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0af24dfc\" id=\"u0af24dfc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d7e8261\" id=\"u5d7e8261\">style=informal</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u67aad84f\" id=\"u67aad84f\">）。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u26cdab60\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u8fce78e0\" data-lake-id=\"u83310528\" id=\"u83310528\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5e97054b\" id=\"u5e97054b\">技术栈</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u911ee6be\" id=\"u911ee6be\">：Hugging Face PEFT + NVIDIA Triton（模型托管） + Prometheus（模型性能监控）。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"ed13251d\" id=\"ed13251d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u93982432\" id=\"u93982432\">3. 配置隔离：租户级策略引擎</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u7f769405\" id=\"u7f769405\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752995438609-b3c5a98e-e1d0-49c0-b419-5b46728a4009.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u200918db-e464-4d0f-909f-36c34fb0055%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u63e39363-fe73-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A406.40000915527344%2C%22height%22%3A197%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A22776%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A462%2C%22originHeight%22%3A224%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E5%BC%95%E6%93%8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A322%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%88%E4%BE