d=\"uc1a9b687\">动态权限</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u057b73ae\" id=\"u057b73ae\">：当对话涉及“转账”时，自动提升审批权限至风控部门。</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%E4%BC%AA%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cnif%20intent%20%3D%3D%20%5C%22transfer%5C%22%20and%20tenant%20%3D%3D%20%5C%22bank_A%5C%22%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20require_approval(role%3D%5C%22risk_control%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LSp1X%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"uf4149250\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u247fb19b\" data-lake-id=\"u705c5125\" id=\"u705c5125\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u16355b2a\" id=\"u16355b2a\">技术栈</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u88fa7c3e\" id=\"u88fa7c3e\">：Kubernetes ConfigMap + Apache Airflow（工作流引擎）。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"60422757\" id=\"60422757\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u597fef5b\" id=\"u597fef5b\">4. 性能隔离：分级资源配额</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"uaf992632\" id=\"uaf992632\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752995456921-16402767-b795-4856-a5d1-f758001c99f6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2f081157-ed7e-435b-b22b-9fa2e069878%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u63e39363-fe73-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A363.8000183105469%2C%22height%22%3A176%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A25066%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A474%2C%22originHeight%22%3A229%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22st